{"title": "The Doji", "type": "Technical lesson", "hooks": ["What does a candle with no body mean? Not what you think.", "See a candle with no body? Don't trade it on its own.", "No body, two long wicks. Don't trade it on its own."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "What does a candle with no body mean? Not what you think.", "text": "A candle with no body", "chart": 0, "show": 88, "win": [27, 122]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "That's a doji", "show": 88, "vo": "That's a doji. Price moved around, but closed almost exactly where it opened. A tie between buyers and sellers.", "cues": [{"say": "That's a doji", "do": "mark", "i": 88, "label": "D", "side": "low", "tone": "amber"}, {"say": "Price moved around", "do": "zoom", "from": 70, "to": 95}], "win": [27, 122]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "After a strong run", "show": 88, "vo": "After a strong run, like this long drop, it can mean momentum is fading.", "cues": [{"say": "this long drop", "do": "shade", "from": 27, "to": 88, "tone": "red"}], "win": [27, 122]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "In a range", "show": 88, "vo": "In a sideways range, it means very little. Buyers and sellers are tied there anyway.", "cues": [{"say": "sideways range", "do": "reveal", "to": 112}, {"say": "means very little", "do": "mark", "i": 99, "label": "D", "side": "high", "tone": "teal"}], "win": [27, 122]}, {"kind": "big", "text": "The next candle shows who won", "vo": "Either way, it's a clue, not a signal. The next candle shows who won.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Practise reading candles", "vo": "Follow for more candle lessons, and practise reading candles at memestreet.net.", "chart": null}], "caption": "What does a candle with no body mean? Not what you think.\n\nThat's a doji. Price moved around but closed almost where it opened. A tie.\nAfter a strong run, it can mean momentum is fading.\nIn a sideways range, it means very little.\nEither way, the next candle shows who won.\n\nFollow fo